A <meteorologist> who collaborated with <Syukuro Manabe> on <climate models>.<Geophysical Fluid Dynamics Laboratory Activities FY00, Plans FY01 by Geophysical Fluid Dynamics Laboratory (U.S.)>[Appendix A-4, staff table: Wetherald, Richard T., Meteorologist]{ref}

